1. Keep track of **which previous index** led to the current `freq[i]` (i.e., the predecessor).
2. After computing the maximum length, **reconstruct the actual indices** by backtracking from the end.
3. Print those indices (or the values, depending on what you want — you said "indices of the elements", so we'll print the **array indices**).

