#### ✅ 步骤 3：创建自定义拦截器（验证 JWT）

```java
@Component
public class JwtAuthenticationInterceptor implements WebSocketInterceptor {

    @Override
    public boolean beforeHandshake(WebSocketSession session, 
                                   HandshakeInterceptor.HandshakeRequest request,
                                   HandshakeInterceptor.HandshakeResponse response,
                                   Map<String, Object> attributes) throws Exception {

        // 1. 从请求参数中获取 token
        List<String> tokens = request.getHttpHeaders().get("Authorization");
        if (tokens == null || tokens.isEmpty()) {
            // 尝试从查询参数中获取
            String token = getQueryParam(request, "token");
            if (token == null || !isValidToken(token)) {
                return false; // 拒绝连接
            }
            attributes.put("username", getUsernameFromToken(token));
        } else {
            String authToken = tokens.get(0);
            if (authToken.startsWith("Bearer ")) {
                String token = authToken.substring(7);
                if (!isValidToken(token)) {
                    return false;
                }
                attributes.put("username", getUsernameFromToken(token));
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        }

        // 2. 验证通过后保存用户信息到 session 层
        session.getAttributes().put("username", attributes.get("username"));
        return true;
    }

    @Override
    public void afterHandshake(WebSocketSession session, 
                               HandshakeInterceptor.HandshakeRequest request,
                               HandshakeInterceptor.HandshakeResponse response,
                               Exception exception) {
        // 可以在此记录日志
    }

    private String getQueryParam(HandshakeInterceptor.HandshakeRequest request, String key) {
        try {
            URI uri = request.getUri();
            String query = uri.getQuery();
            if (query != null && !query.isEmpty()) {
                String[] pairs = query.split("&");
                for (String pair : pairs) {
                    String[] parts = pair.split("=", 2);
                    if (parts.length == 2 && parts[0].equals(key)) {
                        return parts[1];
                    }
                }
            }
        } catch (Exception e) {
            return null;
        }
        return null;
    }

    private boolean isValidToken(String token) {
        try {
            Jwts.parserBuilder()
                .setSigningKey("your-secret-key") // 秘钥应从配置文件读取
                .build()
                .parseClaimsJws(token);
            return true;
        } catch (JwtException e) {
            return false;
        }
    }

    private String getUsernameFromToken(String token) {
        try {
            return Jwts.parserBuilder()
                    .setSigningKey("your-secret-key")
                    .build()
                    .parseClaimsJws(token)
                    .getBody()
                    .getSubject();
        } catch (Exception e) {
            return null;
        }
    }
}
```

> 💡 提示：生产环境请将密钥放在配置文件中，并使用 `@Value("${jwt.secret}")` 读取。

