### 3. Spring Boot 控制器调用服务

```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/stream")
public class StreamController {

    @Autowired
    private ImageToH264StreamService streamService;

    @PostMapping("/image")
    public ResponseEntity<String> sendImageAsH264(
            @RequestParam String imagePath,
            @RequestParam String clientIp,
            @RequestParam int port) {

        streamService.sendImageAsH264Stream(imagePath, clientIp, port);
        return ResponseEntity.ok("H.264 流已发送！");
    }
}
```

> 📌 调用方式：
