### 1. **Set Up Backend (Node.js + Express + SQL)**

#### Setup:
```bash
mkdir backend
cd backend
npm init -y
npm install express mysql2 cors dotenv bcrypt jsonwebtoken
npm install --save-dev nodemon
```

#### `.env` (in backend folder)
```env
