We will build a simple **flight information dashboard** that:
- Fetches flight data from a **database (MongoDB via Mongoose)**
- Displays it on the server-side rendered page
- **Re-renders automatically when the data changes** using **revalidation** (Next.js automatic revalidation) and **client-side polling with `useEffect`**

> ✅ **Important**: While SSR ensures fast first-load performance, real-time updates (when DB changes) require **client-side re-fetching** or **server-sent events (SSE)** or **WebSockets**. We'll use **Next.js revalidation + polling** for simplicity.

