  className: '', // Optional: add custom CSS class if needed
  iconSize: [20, 20],
  iconAnchor: [10, 10], // Center the icon
});

// Create marker with the divIcon
const marker = L.marker(firstPoint, {
  icon: trainIcon,
  zIndexOffset: 1000, // Ensure marker is above other layers
}).addTo(map);
```

> 💡 This will render a **black circle with white text** showing the number of carriages.

---

### 🔄 Update the Number Dynamically

Every time you buy a carriage, `numberOfCarriages` changes. So you must **update the `html` of the icon** to reflect the new value.

